{"overview":"When Pollyanna is orphaned, she's sent to live with her crotchety Aunt Polly. Pollyanna discovers that many of the people in her aunt's New England hometown are as ill-tempered as her aunt. But Pollyanna's incurable optimism - exemplified by her \"glad game\", in which she looks for the bright side of every situation - brings a change to the staid old community.","cast":[{"n":"Mary Pickford","c":"Pollyanna Whittier","p":"/4UaErdt3KcNhObDmxRbWKvHxt6x.jpg","q":"Q104109"},{"n":"Katherine Griffith","c":"Aunt Polly Harrington","p":"/rxMJvezhqhltjgEeNU0xBzhL2DT.jpg","q":"Q2422535"},{"n":"Howard Ralston","c":"Jimmy Bean","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Helen Jerome Eddy","c":"Nancy Thing","p":"/qy5pFT1KLmBzPxZW2osoQGLdP87.jpg","q":"Q727052"},{"n":"George Berrell","c":"Old Tom","p":"/qTaiMJQ8BJrZPAPSAJA6GkoLzMh.jpg","q":"Q5536937"},{"n":"William Courtleigh","c":"John Pendleton","p":"/wacovCBvLrCxXaHOu18IO5LQ4E2.jpg","q":"Q100400646"},{"n":"Herbert Prior","c":"Dr. Tom Chilton","p":"/wN0WTT9TqPt6JvI5JsnGhp2yoMN.jpg","q":"Q3133496"},{"n":"Wharton James","c":"Rev. John Whittier","p":null,"q":"Q31941736"},{"n":"Doc Crane","c":"Bit Role (uncredited)","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Joan Marsh","c":"Bit Role (uncredited)","p":"/rrOmzFHeSotjDsj8LmdTjrnSksX.jpg","q":"Q2615512"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pollyanna_(1920_film)","qid":"Q2582920","rel":{"US":{"d":"1920-01-18"}},"backdrops":["/anbnJb83av3bXKaaEF4tbHtRQEt.jpg","/wtQ09OLxlYyPIKKF33HQtHGgHKI.jpg","/tosVvtrIAig1aCy9LnJDicDIBBS.jpg","/sp0cMZkwu792bFlNWcJLt4dkU2G.jpg","/xlDOu8dqrLqlCTi8TSdbLahhN4W.jpg","/cpmgDt9Kf6z17uokT5bA9y7yZhP.jpg","/xPT52sIySOnjEQpeAvDuAa2K3ap.jpg","/a5ZyO9L4WNAmWq8bo19lOUxudiE.jpg"]}